--- !u!114 &519781138
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 519781136}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d333ed21dbdd3d84383b6176d65d73db, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  enemies:
  - {fileID: 974186856}
  - {fileID: 475954962}
  - {fileID: 2064899600}
  dialoguePlayer: {fileID: 1063082570}
  targetPos:
  - -5.19
  - 1.85
  targetPos2:
  - -5.51
  - -11.76
  player: {fileID: 650320557}
  ponter: {fileID: 1174353865}
  introLines:
  - 'Guard: Stay right there! You''re not going any further!'
  - '!<NAME>!: I suppose it''s the time to battle Magnus'' first battalion.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Alright, then!'
  - '!<NAME>!: Hey, wait a moment... Aren''t you...?'
  - '!<NAME>!: You''re the fisher''s son, aren''t you?'
  - 'Guard: That is none of your business! Fight!'
  perSuc:
  - '!<NAME>!: Look, you still remember your father, which means you are not completely
    lost yet.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Why did you join Magnus? Can''t you see what he''s doing to humanity?'
  - '!<NAME>!: Can''t you see that sooner of later he will destroy our planet? He
    will burn it to the ground with you included.'
  - 'Fisher''s Son: I... I joined him because I admired his vision when he started
    planning to take over the kingdom.'
  - 'Fisher''s Son: I believed that the kingdom must be ruled with a powerful hand,
    that doesn''t back off from any inconvinience.'
  - 'Fisher''s Son: The people... They were weak! I knew that all of this could only
    make them stronger.'
  - '!<NAME>!: And has it paid off? Losing your family to that vision? Sacrificing
    thousands of people that have died because of Magnus?'
  - '!<NAME>!: Do you still support it? All the villages and towns that have been
    ruined?'
  - 'Fisher''s Son: Not entirely. Casualties are unavoidable. A hard medicine to
    swallow, but I''m too far gone.'
  - '!<NAME>!: That''s the thing! You are not! We found a way to beat Magnus! We
    can end him once and for all!'
  - '!<NAME>!: You don''t have to fight us. Go to your father and apologize to him,
    swallow that medicine!'
  - '!<NAME>!: Rebuild your bond and take him far away from here. You can live!'
  - 'Fisher''s Son: Are you sure I can still do that? I''ve done terrible things
    on my duty.'
  - '!<NAME>!: I can see the real you. You''re a good person inside. You''ll have
    to fight your own demons and make amends to the people you''ve hurt.'
  - 'Fisher''s Son:  Can you really beat him?'
  - '!<NAME>!: We can. Trust us. '
  - 'Fisher''s Son:  Fine, then. Magnus is in the throne room.'
  - 'Fisher''s Son: Do what you have to.'
  perFail:
  - '!<NAME>!: Unless you want to be killed, leave this place now and join your father.'
  - '!<NAME>!: You''ll never be as powerful as you wished. We will destroy you if
    you stay on our way.'
  - 'Fisher''s Son: Oh yes? Then prove it!'
  combat: {fileID: 635510724}
  reqPer: 50
  bc: {fileID: 0}
